		FRCTL Mirror 1.5.0


This dataset is the recovery and release mirror for FRCTL. It contains a testable Android APK, a matching source snapshot, product documentation, recovery instructions, and machine-readable release metadata.





		Files



frctl.apk — Android 1.5.0 debug APK for product evaluation;
frctl-source-main.zip — complete source snapshot of the matching GitHub revision;
CHANGELOG.md — release history and build notes;
